#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:5
#: ba833166ccb248668131acc7f685983a
msgid "Camera Triggering using StratosnapperV2"
msgstr "使用 StratosnapperV2 触发相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:7
#: bcc32eff18424a0391cc53301f0d70f7
msgid ""
"This tutorial shows how connect the `Stratosnapper V2 "
"<https://www.mjmulticopter.com/strato-snapper-v2.html>`__ (with an IR "
"Module) to a Sony NEX5 so that its shutter can be triggered from the pilot's"
" transmitter or during :ref:`camera missions <common-camera-control-and-"
"auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"本教程介绍如何将 `Stratosnapper V2 <https://www.mjmulticopter.com/strato-"
"snapper-v2.html>`__（配红外模块）连接到 Sony NEX5，使其快门可通过飞手遥控器或在 :ref:`相机任务 <common-"
"camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>` 期间触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:10
#: 50ebffe7dfdb404bb07f3a23625a67c1
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:12
#: a2f34f2e6de04e92b5476c7bbe5471dc
msgid ""
"This device is becoming increasingly rare but can still be found on "
"`mjmulticopter.com <https://www.mjmulticopter.com/strato-snapper-v2.html>`__"
" and `ebay <https://www.ebay.com/itm/Strato-Snapper-V2-Control-For-Drone-"
"Photography-Camera-Zoom-Or-Switch/312473455984>`__"
msgstr ""
"此设备日益罕见，但仍可在 `mjmulticopter.com <https://www.mjmulticopter.com/strato-"
"snapper-v2.html>`__ 和 `ebay <https://www.ebay.com/itm/Strato-"
"Snapper-V2-Control-For-Drone-Photography-Camera-Zoom-Or-"
"Switch/312473455984>`__ 上找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:15
#: 45918f9bcdeb40fbb5fec60e21bd4423
msgid "Parts and hardware connections"
msgstr "零件和硬件连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:17
#: 95bb7239a8ee46d8971260690abba9cf
msgid ""
"The diagram below shows the required parts and general cabling. This "
"includes the Pixhawk, IR Trigger device (*Stratosnapper*), IR LED and "
"camera, and the BEC to power the *Stratosnapper*."
msgstr ""
"下图显示了所需零件和基本接线，包括 Pixhawk、红外触发设备（*Stratosnapper*）、红外 LED 和相机，以及为 "
"*Stratosnapper* 供电的 BEC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:30
#: 7afe236625da4b639c990921664d387c
msgid "Pixhawk board"
msgstr "Pixhawk 板卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:32
#: 8038273095534f7d9238d954af6d4604
msgid ""
"Pixhawk has 6 AUX ports that may be used for triggering the camera (see "
"AUX1-AUX6 = RC9-RC14). This tutorial uses port 2/AUX2, as shown in the "
"diagram below:"
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 有 6 个 AUX 端口可用于触发相机（AUX1-AUX6 = RC9-RC14）。本教程使用端口 2/AUX2，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:41
#: b7253a6fcd1a40109adc99e983b89a3a
msgid "IR trigger device"
msgstr "红外触发设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:43
#: 943efbed4c274f22b900ca4849d19b90
msgid ""
"The *Stratosnapper* with its inputs/outputs is shown below. The servo inputs"
" can be push-buttons, sticks, two or three-way switches, etc. These are "
"configured using a GUI configuration utility from your PC via USB."
msgstr ""
"*Stratosnapper* 的输入/输出如下图所示。舵机输入可以是按钮、摇杆、两档或三档拨杆等，通过 PC 端 USB 连接的 GUI "
"配置工具进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:52
#: a442c7e9004e46e4ba29a1a1684d5f3b
msgid ""
"Note the two servo leads are connected on the input side of *Stratosnapper*;"
" one of these is to power the IR module."
msgstr "请注意，两根舵机线连接在 *Stratosnapper* 的输入侧；其中一根用于为红外模块供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:57
#: 07d2a9652e77418e8d244dc3519d9a52
msgid ""
"It is not possible to power the IR module (or any other device) from the "
"Pixhawk AUX ports. You must either power provide a separate BEC to power the"
" IR device or power the Pixhawk outputs rail with a BEC and power the device"
" off that."
msgstr ""
"无法从 Pixhawk AUX 端口为红外模块（或任何其他设备）供电。您必须提供独立 BEC 为红外设备供电，或通过 BEC 为 Pixhawk "
"输出轨供电并从该轨道为设备供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:62
#: 3e872e624ea047e68742867c31097e0d
msgid ""
"The control signal from Pixhawk can be assigned to any of the 4 servo "
"inputs."
msgstr "来自 Pixhawk 的控制信号可分配给 4 个舵机输入中的任意一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:68
#: d092c94cd7494aa99be66568f26856cc
msgid ""
"The output of the *Stratosnapper* is shown below. It connects to an IR "
"cable, which in turn triggers a IR led that must be placed in front of your "
"camera IR sensor:"
msgstr "*Stratosnapper* 的输出如下图所示。它连接到红外数据线，进而触发必须放置在相机红外传感器前方的红外 LED："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:76
#: 860f3fa8b1bf478fa669681cd2f1d509
msgid "IR LED positioning and camera gimbal"
msgstr "红外 LED 定位和相机云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:78
#: 4f56a45d75a440f39eb8e57c65c9fe7e
msgid ""
"The Sony NEX5 is held in a 2-axis stabilized brushless gimbal (NEX5 not "
"shown). Here below a zoomed view of the IR LED positioning and gimbal:"
msgstr "Sony NEX5 安装在两轴稳定无刷云台中（图中未显示 NEX5）。以下为红外 LED 定位和云台的放大视图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:84
#: 520b3f96c013488a87e05c6561ec21e7
msgid ""
"The IR LED works well even in bright sunlight (verified in the field). It "
"also works some distance from the sensor (no problem within 5inches of the "
"Sony NEX5 sensor) and in any orientation with respect to the sensor."
msgstr ""
"红外 LED 在强烈阳光下也能正常工作（已在现场验证）。它在距传感器一定距离处也能工作（距 Sony NEX5 传感器 5 "
"英寸以内无问题），且方向不受限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:90
#: 63c631a9ba3844a7a265ecfeb9eb0748
msgid "Camera shutter configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的相机快门配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:92
#: 35f0254a3ac74ffd8a68cff69ce07c41
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` article explains how to configure Pixhawk AUX output as"
" a servo camera trigger."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` 一文介绍如何将 Pixhawk AUX 输出配置为舵机相机触发器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:95
#: 8365395946a4442c930244dde21ffb11
msgid ""
"The parameters used to configure this Stratosnapper/IR/NEX5 hardware are "
"listed below:"
msgstr "以下列出配置此 Stratosnapper/IR/NEX5 硬件所用的参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:98
#: 86f52f35a9644acca22630a64d71c435
msgid "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``: 0 (Servo)."
msgstr "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``：0（Servo）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:99
#: 0f62b378725f4c1a8a5a1c58cd291e31
msgid "``Shutter (Port)``: RC10 (AUX2)."
msgstr "``Shutter (Port)``：RC10（AUX2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:100
#: e0ed97ed2a564ce084bacdfc44344803
msgid "``Shutter Pushed``: 1800"
msgstr "``Shutter Pushed``：1800"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:101
#: 07134eb273004d76b2f9422584e347ba
msgid "``Shutter Not Pushed``: 1100"
msgstr "``Shutter Not Pushed``：1100"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:102
#: 968d6096898e4e0087be3d15e735df7c
msgid "``Shutter Duration``: 10 (1 second)"
msgstr "``Shutter Duration``：10（1 秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:103
#: dee2e88583e143fca50f73ef6473b0f0
msgid "``Servo Limits Max``: 1900"
msgstr "``Servo Limits Max``：1900"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:104
#: f626a0aac75d4d21baa6ea49e883e0fd
msgid "``Servo Limits Min``: 1100"
msgstr "``Servo Limits Min``：1100"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:105
#: 339a12f5a16c4390836c4ff46d605cae
msgid ""
"``CH7_OPT`` : 9 (Optional - enables manual shutter triggering on Copter "
"only)."
msgstr "``CH7_OPT``：9（可选——仅在 Copter 上启用手动快门触发）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:111
#: 386db7e7c2264b8b879a02aae7b3de3c
msgid "Mission Planner: Camera GimbalSetup Screen"
msgstr "Mission Planner：相机云台设置界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:114
#: 8ad60842edcb4bbab5bde21ce441788f
