msgstr "红外设备配置（Stratosnapper V2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:116
#: c5c2926cd669487dbede9b20c3a785e2
msgid ""
"Every IR device has its own configuration method. *Stratosnapper* comes with"
" a simple GUI interface to define which PWM values will trigger what port."
msgstr "每种红外设备都有其自己的配置方式。*Stratosnapper* 附带简单的 GUI 界面，用于定义哪些 PWM 值触发哪个端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:120
#: 948e30a4e2534006b3a45eef1002e98e
